          "anchor": "MRK.16.2",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.2"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.2"
        },
        {
          "text": " just after sunrise, they went to the tomb.",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.2",
          "marks": [],
          "originalText": " just after sunrise, they went to the tomb. ",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.2"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.2"
        },
        {
          "verse": "3",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.3",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.3"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.3"
        },
        {
          "text": "They were asking one another, “Who will roll away the stone from the entrance of the tomb?”",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.3",
          "marks": [],
          "originalText": "They were asking one another, “Who will roll away the stone from the entrance of the tomb?” ",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.3"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.3"
        },
        {
          "verse": "4",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.4",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.4"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.4"
        },
        {
          "text": "But when they looked up, they saw that the stone had been rolled away, even though it was extremely large.",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.4",
          "marks": [],
          "originalText": "But when they looked up, they saw that the stone had been rolled away, even though it was extremely large.",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.4"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.4"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "marker": "p",
      "role": "scripture",
