          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.5"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.5"
        },
        {
          "text": "When they entered the tomb, they saw a young man dressed in a white robe sitting on the right side, and they were alarmed.",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.5",
          "marks": [],
          "originalText": "When they entered the tomb, they saw a young man dressed in a white robe sitting on the right side, and they were alarmed. ",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.5"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.5"
        },
        {
          "verse": "6",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.6",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.6"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.6"
        },
        {
          "text": "But he said to them, “Do not be alarmed. You are looking for Jesus the Nazarene, who was crucified. He has risen! He is not here! See the place where they put Him.",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.6",
          "marks": [],
          "originalText": "But he said to them, “Do not be alarmed. You are looking for Jesus the Nazarene, who was crucified. He has risen! He is not here! See the place where they put Him. ",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.6"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.6"
        },
        {
          "verse": "7",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.7",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.7"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.7"
        },
        {
          "text": "But go, tell His disciples and Peter, ‘He is going ahead of you into Galilee. There you will see Him, just as He told you.’”",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.7",
          "marks": [],
          "originalText": "But go, tell His disciples and Peter, ‘He is going ahead of you into Galilee. There you will see Him, just as He told you.’”",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.7"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.7"
        }
      ]
    },
