    {
      "id": "MRK.16.2",
      "sourceId": "bsb_usj/MRK.usj#content/620/content/3",
      "sourceLabel": "2",
      "anchors": [
        "MRK.16.2"
      ],
      "mappingType": "exact",
      "text": "Very early on the first day of the week, just after sunrise, they went to the tomb.",
      "originalStructuredText": "Very early on the first day of the week, just after sunrise, they went to the tomb. ",
      "sourceRef": "MRK.16.2"
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.16.3",
      "sourceId": "bsb_usj/MRK.usj#content/620/content/7",
      "sourceLabel": "3",
      "anchors": [
        "MRK.16.3"
      ],
      "mappingType": "exact",
      "text": "They were asking one another, “Who will roll away the stone from the entrance of the tomb?”",
      "originalStructuredText": "They were asking one another, “Who will roll away the stone from the entrance of the tomb?” ",
      "sourceRef": "MRK.16.3"
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.16.4",
      "sourceId": "bsb_usj/MRK.usj#content/620/content/9",
      "sourceLabel": "4",
      "anchors": [
        "MRK.16.4"
      ],
      "mappingType": "exact",
      "text": "But when they looked up, they saw that the stone had been rolled away, even though it was extremely large.",
      "originalStructuredText": "But when they looked up, they saw that the stone had been rolled away, even though it was extremely large.\n ",
      "sourceRef": "MRK.16.4"
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.16.5",
      "sourceId": "bsb_usj/MRK.usj#content/621/content/1",
      "sourceLabel": "5",
      "anchors": [
        "MRK.16.5"
      ],
      "mappingType": "exact",
      "text": "When they entered the tomb, they saw a young man dressed in a white robe sitting on the right side, and they were alarmed.",
      "originalStructuredText": "When they entered the tomb, they saw a young man dressed in a white robe sitting on the right side, and they were alarmed. ",
      "sourceRef": "MRK.16.5"
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.16.6",
      "sourceId": "bsb_usj/MRK.usj#content/621/content/3",
      "sourceLabel": "6",
      "anchors": [
        "MRK.16.6"
      ],
      "mappingType": "exact",
      "text": "But he said to them, “Do not be alarmed. You are looking for Jesus the Nazarene, who was crucified. He has risen! He is not here! See the place where they put Him.",
      "originalStructuredText": "But he said to them, “Do not be alarmed. You are looking for Jesus the Nazarene, who was crucified. He has risen! He is not here! See the place where they put Him. ",
      "sourceRef": "MRK.16.6"
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.16.7",
      "sourceId": "bsb_usj/MRK.usj#content/621/content/5",
      "sourceLabel": "7",
      "anchors": [
        "MRK.16.7"
      ],
      "mappingType": "exact",
      "text": "But go, tell His disciples and Peter, ‘He is going ahead of you into Galilee. There you will see Him, just as He told you.’”",
      "originalStructuredText": "But go, tell His disciples and Peter, ‘He is going ahead of you into Galilee. There you will see Him, just as He told you.’”\n ",
      "sourceRef": "MRK.16.7"
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.16.8",
      "sourceId": "bsb_usj/MRK.usj#content/622/content/1",
      "sourceLabel": "8",
      "anchors": [
        "MRK.16.8"
      ],
      "mappingType": "exact",
      "text": "So the women left the tomb and ran away, trembling and bewildered. And in their fear they did not say a word to anyone.",
      "originalStructuredText": "So the women left the tomb and ran away, trembling and bewildered. And in their fear they did not say a word to anyone.\n ",
      "sourceRef": "MRK.16.8"
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.16.9",
      "sourceId": "bsb_usj/MRK.usj#content/625/content/1",
      "sourceLabel": "9",
      "anchors": [
        "MRK.16.9"
      ],
      "mappingType": "exact",
      "text": "Early on the first day of the week, after Jesus had risen, He appeared first to Mary Magdalene, from whom He had driven out seven demons.",
      "originalStructuredText": "Early on the first day of the week, after Jesus had risen, He appeared first to Mary Magdalene, from whom He had driven out seven demons. ",
      "sourceRef": "MRK.16.9"
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.16.10",
      "sourceId": "bsb_usj/MRK.usj#content/625/content/5",
      "sourceLabel": "10",
      "anchors": [
        "MRK.16.10"
      ],
      "mappingType": "exact",
      "text": "She went and told those who had been with Him, who were mourning and weeping.",
      "originalStructuredText": "She went and told those who had been with Him, who were mourning and weeping. ",
      "sourceRef": "MRK.16.10"
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.16.11",
      "sourceId": "bsb_usj/MRK.usj#content/625/content/7",
      "sourceLabel": "11",
      "anchors": [
        "MRK.16.11"
      ],
      "mappingType": "exact",
      "text": "And when they heard that Jesus was alive and she had seen Him, they did not believe it.",
      "originalStructuredText": "And when they heard that Jesus was alive and she had seen Him, they did not believe it.\n ",
      "sourceRef": "MRK.16.11"
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.16.12",
      "sourceId": "bsb_usj/MRK.usj#content/628/content/1",
      "sourceLabel": "12",
      "anchors": [
        "MRK.16.12"
      ],
      "mappingType": "exact",
      "text": "After this, Jesus appeared in a different form to two of them as they walked along in the country.",
      "originalStructuredText": "After this, Jesus appeared in a different form to two of them as they walked along in the country.\n ",
      "sourceRef": "MRK.16.12"
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.16.13",
      "sourceId": "bsb_usj/MRK.usj#content/629/content/1",
      "sourceLabel": "13",
      "anchors": [
        "MRK.16.13"
      ],
      "mappingType": "exact",
      "text": "And they went back and reported it to the rest, but they did not believe them either.",
      "originalStructuredText": "And they went back and reported it to the rest, but they did not believe them either.\n ",
      "sourceRef": "MRK.16.13"
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.16.14",
      "sourceId": "bsb_usj/MRK.usj#content/632/content/1",
      "sourceLabel": "14",
      "anchors": [
        "MRK.16.14"
      ],
      "mappingType": "exact",
      "text": "Later, as they were eating, Jesus appeared to the Eleven and rebuked them for their unbelief and hardness of heart, because they did not believe those who had seen Him after He had risen.",
      "originalStructuredText": "Later, as they were eating, Jesus appeared to the Eleven and rebuked them for their unbelief and hardness of heart, because they did not believe those who had seen Him after He had risen.\n ",
      "sourceRef": "MRK.16.14"
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.16.15",
      "sourceId": "bsb_usj/MRK.usj#content/633/content/1",
      "sourceLabel": "15",
      "anchors": [
        "MRK.16.15"
      ],
      "mappingType": "exact",
      "text": "And He said to them, “Go into all the world and preach the gospel to every creature.",
      "originalStructuredText": "And He said to them, “Go into all the world and preach the gospel to every creature. ",
      "sourceRef": "MRK.16.15"
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.16.16",
      "sourceId": "bsb_usj/MRK.usj#content/633/content/3/content/1",
      "sourceLabel": "16",
      "anchors": [
        "MRK.16.16"
      ],
      "mappingType": "exact",
      "text": "Whoever believes and is baptized will be saved, but whoever does not believe will be condemned.",
      "originalStructuredText": "Whoever believes and is baptized will be saved, but whoever does not believe will be condemned. ",
      "sourceRef": "MRK.16.16"
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.16.17",
      "sourceId": "bsb_usj/MRK.usj#content/633/content/3/content/3",
      "sourceLabel": "17",
      "anchors": [
        "MRK.16.17"
      ],
      "mappingType": "exact",
      "text": "And these signs will accompany those who believe: In My name they will drive out demons; they will speak in new tongues;",
      "originalStructuredText": "And these signs will accompany those who believe: In My name they will drive out demons; they will speak in new tongues;",
      "sourceRef": "MRK.16.17"
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.16.18",
      "sourceId": "bsb_usj/MRK.usj#content/633/content/3/content/6",
      "sourceLabel": "18",
      "anchors": [
        "MRK.16.18"
      ],
      "mappingType": "exact",
      "text": "they will pick up snakes with their hands, and if they drink any deadly poison, it will not harm them; they will lay their hands on the sick, and they will be made well.”",
      "originalStructuredText": "they will pick up snakes with their hands, and if they drink any deadly poison, it will not harm them; they will lay their hands on the sick, and they will be made well.”\n ",
      "sourceRef": "MRK.16.18"
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.16.19",
      "sourceId": "bsb_usj/MRK.usj#content/636/content/1",
      "sourceLabel": "19",
      "anchors": [
        "MRK.16.19"
      ],
      "mappingType": "exact",
      "text": "After the Lord Jesus had spoken to them, He was taken up into heaven and sat down at the right hand of God.",
      "originalStructuredText": "After the Lord Jesus had spoken to them, He was taken up into heaven and sat down at the right hand of God.\n ",
      "sourceRef": "MRK.16.19"
    },
    {
      "id": "MRK.16.20",
      "sourceId": "bsb_usj/MRK.usj#content/637/content/1",
      "sourceLabel": "20",
      "anchors": [
        "MRK.16.20"
      ],
      "mappingType": "exact",
      "text": "And they went out and preached everywhere, and the Lord worked through them, confirming His word by the signs that accompanied it.",
      "originalStructuredText": "And they went out and preached everywhere, and the Lord worked through them, confirming His word by the signs that accompanied it.",
      "sourceRef": "MRK.16.20"
    }
  ],
